# QATS Agentic AI — Setup & Architecture

## What this is

An autonomous AI agent system built on top of your existing QATS.
Five agents run in the background, each following the **perceive → decide → act** loop.
Claude (claude-sonnet-4-6) provides natural-language reasoning for each decision.
All actions are logged to the database for full auditability.

---

## Files

```
qats/
└── agent/
    ├── agent.php          ← Core engine — all 5 agents, Anthropic API calls
    ├── run.php            ← Browser UI (admin only) to trigger agents manually
    ├── cron.php           ← CLI script for scheduled automatic execution
    └── notifications.php  ← Notification inbox for dept users and PQC
```

