## Offline mode (no API key)

All agents work without the Anthropic API key using rule-based fallbacks:
- TriageAgent: uses CTQ flag and stage rules to set severity
- EscalationAgent: uses days-overdue thresholds
- RCASuggestionAgent: copies the most recent historical RCA
- AlertAgent: uses a template message with the line data
- ShiftHandoverAgent: generates a structured text summary from the DB stats

Set the key when you're ready for full Claude reasoning.

