## Agent Log

Every action is logged to `agent_log`. You can query it:
```sql
SELECT agent_name, action, entity_type, entity_id, result, reasoning, created_at
FROM agent_log
ORDER BY created_at DESC
LIMIT 50;
```

The Run UI at `agent/run.php` shows the last 40 log entries live.
